      "text": "1 to 3\n\nFrequency once per round.\n\n---\nEffect The angry townsfolk engage in a coordinated melee attack against each enemy within 10 feet, with a DC 19 basic Reflex save save. The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n1 1d10 untyped damage\n\n2 1d10+7 untyped damage\n\n3 1d10+10 untyped damage",
